3. Check load-balancer request logs
  GKE Ingress does not have a dedicated controller Pod for you to inspect with kubectl logs. Instead, use Cloud Logging:

gcloud logging read \
  'resource.type="http_load_balancer"' \
  --project=weather-project-prod-511603 \
  --limit=20 \
  --format="table(timestamp,httpRequest.requestMethod,httpRequest.requestUrl,httpRequest.status)"

