### Delete Services
  1. Delete the Ingress first
   kubectl delete ingress microservices-ingress

  2. Delete the Services
  kubectl delete svc user-service product-service order-service

  3. Delete the Pods
  kubectl delete deployment user-service product-service order-service

  4. Verify everything is removed
  kubectl get pods
  kubectl get svc
  kubectl get ingress
  kubectl get deployments

  Alternative: Delete everything created by your Kubernetes YAML files
    kubectl delete -f helm/ecommerce1.0/user/